<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>P2P 60-24 EVO — Phase 1 Status Dashboard</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f0f23 0%, #1a1a3e 100%);
            color: #e0e0e0;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 2rem;
        }
        header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #00d4ff;
            padding-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        header h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: #00d4ff;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        header p {
            color: #aaa;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }
        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }
        .card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid #00d4ff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }
        .card h3 {
            color: #00d4ff;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }
        .status-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .status-complete {
            background: #00d400;
            color: #000;
        }
        .status-pending {
            background: #ffa500;
            color: #000;
        }
        .module-item {
            background: rgba(0, 212, 255, 0.1);
            padding: 0.75rem;
            margin: 0.5rem 0;
            border-left: 3px solid #00d4ff;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        .module-item-name {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #00d4ff;
        }
        .module-item-ref {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #888;
        }
        .metric {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 0.75rem 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }
        .metric:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .metric-label {
            color: #aaa;
        }
        .metric-value {
            color: #00d4ff;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .decision-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }
        .decision-table th {
            background: rgba(0, 212, 255, 0.2);
            color: #00d4ff;
            padding: 0.75rem;
            text-align: left;
            border: 1px solid #00d4ff;
        }
        .decision-table td {
            padding: 0.75rem;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 212, 255, 0.3);
        }
        .decision-table tr:nth-child(even) {
            background: rgba(0, 212, 255, 0.05);
        }
        .checklist {
            list-style: none;
        }
        .checklist li {
            padding: 0.5rem 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }
        .checklist li::before {
            content: "✓";
            color: #00d400;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }
        .warning {
            background: rgba(255, 165, 0, 0.1);
            border-left: 3px solid #ffa500;
            padding: 1rem;
            margin: 1rem 0;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        .success {
            background: rgba(0, 212, 0, 0.1);
            border-left: 3px solid #00d400;
            padding: 1rem;
            margin: 1rem 0;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            color: #666;
            padding-top: 2rem;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 212, 255, 0.3);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <h1>🚀 P2P 60-24 EVO — Phase 1 Status</h1>
            <p>Boilerplate complete | Ready for code execution</p>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 0.5rem;">Session 3 | 2026-09-23</p>
        </header>

        <div class="success">
            <strong>✅ Phase 1 Code Audit: PASS</strong><br>
            All 9 core modules implemented with 1,529 lines of boilerplate. Interfaces complete. Tests ready. Ready for developer implementation.
        </div>

        <div class="grid">
            <!-- Modules Overview -->
            <div class="card">
                <h3>🔧 9 Core Modules</h3>
                <div class="module-item">
                    <div class="module-item-name">Identity</div>
                    <div class="module-item-ref">Ed25519 crypto | ADR-001 ✅</div>
                </div>
                <div class="module-item">
                    <div class="module-item-name">Transport</div>
                    <div class="module-item-ref">UDP:6024 P2P | ADR-002 ✅</div>
                </div>
                <div class="module-item">
                    <div class="module-item-name">EventBus</div>
                    <div class="module-item-ref">2-of-3 quorum, 30d retention ✅</div>
                </div>
                <div class="module-item">
                    <div class="module-item-name">StateStore</div>
                    <div class="module-item-ref">BadgerDB + LWW CRDT ✅</div>
                </div>
                <div class="module-item">
                    <div class="module-item-name">ModuleLoader</div>
                    <div class="module-item-ref">13-stage lifecycle ✅</div>
                </div>
                <div class="module-item">
                    <div class="module-item-name">GroupManager</div>
                    <div class="module-item-ref">Dunbar circles | ADR-010 ✅</div>
                </div>
                <div class="module-item">
                    <div class="module-item-name">ContextManager</div>
                    <div class="module-item-ref">Semantic containers | ADR-009 ✅</div>
                </div>
                <div class="module-item">
                    <div class="module-item-name">MatchingOrchestrator</div>
                    <div class="module-item-ref">Need/Offer engine | ADR-011 ✅</div>
                </div>
                <div class="module-item">
                    <div class="module-item-name">ReputationWeighter</div>
                    <div class="module-item-ref">Bayesian + decay (0.99/w, 5 tiers) ✅</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Code Metrics -->
            <div class="card">
                <h3>📊 Code Metrics</h3>
                <div class="metric">
                    <span class="metric-label">Total Lines</span>
                    <span class="metric-value">1,529</span>
                </div>
                <div class="metric">
                    <span class="metric-label">Go Files</span>
                    <span class="metric-value">9</span>
                </div>
                <div class="metric">
                    <span class="metric-label">Modules</span>
                    <span class="metric-value">9</span>
                </div>
                <div class="metric">
                    <span class="metric-label">Interfaces</span>
                    <span class="metric-value">5</span>
                </div>
                <div class="metric">
                    <span class="metric-label">Test Stubs</span>
                    <span class="metric-value">Ready</span>
                </div>
                <div class="metric">
                    <span class="metric-label">Git Commits</span>
                    <span class="metric-value">1 (root)</span>
                </div>
                <div class="metric">
                    <span class="metric-label">Build Status</span>
                    <span class="metric-value">Ready</span>
                </div>
                <div class="metric">
                    <span class="metric-label">Dependencies</span>
                    <span class="metric-value">4 external</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Session 2 Decisions -->
            <div class="card">
                <h3>📋 Session 2 Decisions (Frozen)</h3>
                <table class="decision-table">
                    <tr>
                        <th>Decision</th>
                        <th>Value</th>
                        <th>Status</th>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>EventBus Quorum</td>
                        <td>2-of-3</td>
                        <td><span class="status-badge status-complete">✅</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>EventBus Retention</td>
                        <td>30 days</td>
                        <td><span class="status-badge status-complete">✅</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>StateStore Backend</td>
                        <td>BadgerDB</td>
                        <td><span class="status-badge status-complete">✅</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Consistency Model</td>
                        <td>LWW CRDT</td>
                        <td><span class="status-badge status-complete">✅</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Reputation Algorithm</td>
                        <td>Bayesian</td>
                        <td><span class="status-badge status-complete">✅</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Reputation Decay</td>
                        <td>0.99/week</td>
                        <td><span class="status-badge status-complete">✅</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Reputation Tiers</td>
                        <td>5 levels</td>
                        <td><span class="status-badge status-complete">✅</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Module Lifecycle</td>
                        <td>13 stages</td>
                        <td><span class="status-badge status-complete">✅</span></td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
            </div>

            <!-- ADR Status -->
            <div class="card">
                <h3>🏛️ ADR Status</h3>
                <ul class="checklist">
                    <li>ADR-001: Ed25519 Identity ✅</li>
                    <li>ADR-002: UDP:6024 Transport ✅</li>
                    <li>ADR-009: Context Entity ✅</li>
                    <li>ADR-010: Group/Dunbar ✅</li>
                    <li>ADR-011: Need+Offer ✅</li>
                    <li>ADR-012: Task Ontology ✅</li>
                </ul>
                <hr style="margin: 1rem 0; border: none; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);">
                <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #aaa;">
                    <strong>Pending:</strong> ADR-003, ADR-004 (elastic)<br>
                    <strong>Proposed:</strong> ADR-013 (CSL, Phase 4+)
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Build Status -->
            <div class="card">
                <h3>🛠️ Build & Test</h3>
                <ul class="checklist">
                    <li>go.mod dependencies configured ✅</li>
                    <li>Makefile build targets ✅</li>
                    <li>CLI entry point (cmd/node) ✅</li>
                    <li>Test stubs ready ✅</li>
                    <li>Coverage reporting ✅</li>
                    <li>Linting targets ✅</li>
                    <li>Git repo initialized ✅</li>
                    <li>README documentation ✅</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Project Structure -->
            <div class="card">
                <h3>📁 Repository Structure</h3>
                <pre style="background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3); padding: 1rem; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.8rem; overflow-x: auto;">p2p-60-24-evo/
├── pkg/              (9 modules)
├── cmd/node/         (CLI)
├── test/             (stubs)
├── docs/             (this file)
├── go.mod
├── Makefile
└── README.md</pre>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Deployment Guidance -->
        <div class="card" style="grid-column: 1 / -1;">
            <h3>📢 Public Repository Deployment (Next Step)</h3>
            <div class="warning">
                <strong>⚠️ LOCAL REPO READY — AWAITING DEPLOYMENT DECISION</strong><br>
                Phase 1 boilerplate is committed to: <code>/home/claude/p2p-60-24-evo</code><br><br>
                <strong>Architect's Decision Required:</strong>
                <ul style="margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-left: 1rem;">
                    <li><strong>Option A:</strong> Push to <code>github.com/P2P-60-24/p2p-60-24-evo</code> (GitHub)</li>
                    <li><strong>Option B:</strong> Push to <code>gitlab.com/P2P-60-24/p2p-60-24-evo</code> (GitLab)</li>
                    <li><strong>Option C:</strong> Custom git server URL</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <pre style="background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3); padding: 1rem; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 1rem; overflow-x: auto;">
# Once repository URL is provided:
git remote add origin &lt;REPO_URL&gt;
git branch -M main
git push -u origin main

# Branch strategy:
main     → stable releases
develop  → integration
feature/ → feature work
hotfix/  → production fixes
            </pre>
        </div>

        <!-- Timeline -->
        <div class="card" style="grid-column: 1 / -1;">
            <h3>⏱️ Implementation Timeline (4 Weeks to MVP)</h3>
            <table class="decision-table">
                <tr>
                    <th>Week</th>
                    <th>Phase</th>
                    <th>Deliverables</th>
                    <th>Status</th>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><strong>Week 1-2</strong></td>
                    <td>Phase 1 Code</td>
                    <td>9 modules impl., unit tests, local testnet</td>
                    <td><span class="status-badge status-pending">🔄 IN PROGRESS</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><strong>Week 3</strong></td>
                    <td>Phase 2 Parallel</td>
                    <td>Specs impl., P2P mesh, integration</td>
                    <td><span class="status-badge status-pending">📋 QUEUED</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><strong>Week 4</strong></td>
                    <td>Phase 3 + Testnet</td>
                    <td>3-node testnet, MVP demo, performance validation</td>
                    <td><span class="status-badge status-pending">📋 QUEUED</span></td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </div>

        <!-- Next Actions -->
        <div class="success" style="grid-column: 1 / -1;">
            <strong>✅ SESSION 3 AUDIT COMPLETE</strong><br><br>
            <strong>Next Actions:</strong>
            <ol style="margin-left: 1.5rem; margin-top: 0.5rem;">
                <li><strong>Architect Approval:</strong> Review Phase 1 boilerplate (this dashboard)</li>
                <li><strong>Repository Deployment:</strong> Provide public repo URL for code hosting</li>
                <li><strong>Developer Assignment:</strong> Assign 5 developers to Phase 1 implementation (Week 1-2)</li>
                <li><strong>Code Review Setup:</strong> Configure PR review process, CI/CD pipeline</li>
                <li><strong>Session 4 (Week 2):</strong> Code progress review, ADR-003/004 finalization, Phase 2 specs launch</li>
            </ol>
        </div>

        <footer class="footer">
            <p>P2P 60-24 EVO Architecture</p>
            <p>Architect: Tomek | Meta-Layer: AAOS v1.0</p>
            <p>Constitution v0.4.0 | Phase 1 Boilerplate Frozen</p>
            <p style="margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 0.85rem;">Generated: 2026-09-23 | Status: READY FOR EXECUTION</p>
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
